Dear Sir/Madam, 
 
Sub: Disclosure under Regulation 30 read with Clause 7 of Paragraph A of Part A of Schedule III of the SEBI 
(Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015 (“SEBI Listing Regulations”) 
 
We wish to inform you that Mr. Sudhir Kumar Jha, Group Head - Legal & Group General Counsel, has superannuated 
from the services of the Bank with effect from the close of business hours on September 30, 2026 and consequently 
has also ceased to be a Senior Management Personnel of the Bank. 
The Bank would like to place on record its sincere appreciation for the dedicated services provided by Mr. Jha 
throughout his 22 years of association with HDFC Group (including Housing Development Finance Corporation 
Limited and the Bank). In his capacity as the Legal & Group General Counsel, he has been instrumental in 
strengthening the Bank’s legal and compliance framework and ensuring effective and prudent management of legal 
risks across the Bank. 
As informed earlier vide intimation dated June 29, 2026, Mr. Jigar Shah, General Counsel – Designate will assume 
the position of General Counsel of the Bank in place of Mr. Jha, effective from October 1, 2026. 
The disclosures required under Regulation 30 read with Clause 7 of Paragraph A of Part A of Schedule III of the SEBI 
Listing Regulations, and SEBI Master Circular No. HO/49/14/14(7)2025‑CFD‑POD2/I/3762/2026 dated January 30, 
2026, in relation to Mr. Jigar Shah, have already been provided in the intimation dated June 29, 2026. 
This is for your information and appropriate dissemination. 
 
Thank you. 
Yours faithfully, 
For HDFC Bank Limited 
 
 
Ajay Agarwal 
